# Wave W17-K (Lastlight Pass): pass pine — a stern high-pass pine in grey-greens, tiered and sparse against the wind, its highlight lifted clear of the pale turf, on pass turf (ground baked in). The pines that close in along the Conference road — greyer and sterner than Route 46’s wind-shaped ridge pine.
